          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઠરાવવું — ṭharāvvũ — \"to settle on (a decision)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અમે ઠરાવ્યું છે કે જો વરસાદ પડશે તો અમે નહીં જઈએ. ame ṭharāvyũ che ke jo varsād paḍśe to ame nahī̃ jaīe. We have decided that if it rains we won't go."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે ઠરાવ્યું, teṇe ṭharāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઠરાવવું (ṭharāvvũ) is the causative of ઠરવું, \"to settle, to become fixed\", which CDIAL lists under stharati, \"is firm\" (CDIAL 13742): to make a decision firm."
            }
          ]
        },
