          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કસોટી — kasoṭī — \"a touchstone; a hard test\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે આ કસોટીમાં મક્કમ રહેશો તો તમને આ નોકરી મળશે. jo tame ā kasoṭīmā̃ makkam raheśo to tamne ā nokrī maḷśe. If you stand firm through this test, you will get this job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કસોટી (kasoṭī) is first the touchstone, the dark stone on which gold is rubbed to show its worth, and so any hard test. CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, \"a touchstone\", under Sanskrit kaṣapaṭṭikā (CDIAL 2973); the sense of a trial it does not give."
            }
          ]
        },
