          "title": "You'll want to know: ઝંપલાવવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઝંપલાવવું — jhamplāvvũ — \"to take the plunge\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો હું ત્યારે ધંધામાં ઝંપલાવત તો આજે હું અમીર હોત. jo hũ tyāre dhandhāmā̃ jhamplāvat to āje hũ amīr hot. If I had taken the plunge into business then, I would be rich today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે ધંધામાં ઝંપલાવ્યું, teṇe dhandhāmā̃ jhamplāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઝંપલાવવું (jhamplāvvũ) is perhaps related to a reconstructed jhapp, \"sudden movement\", with a variant jhamp-, \"a jump\", under which CDIAL lists a Gujarati verb, \"to throw headlong\" (CDIAL 5336); this form is not listed, so its history is not settled. One plunges into water, or into a venture."
            }
          ]
        },
